{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18472","headline":"咏德上韦检察 · 欧阳詹","name":"咏德上韦检察","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少华类太华，太室似少室。\n亚相与丞相，亦复无异质。\n渟如月临水，肃若松照日。\n辉影互光澄，阴森两葱郁。\n连城鸾凤分，同气龟龙出。\n并力革夷心，通筹整师律。\n英豪愿回席，蛮貊皆屈膝。\n中外行分途，寰瀛待清谧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18472.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18472","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}